    "title": "Evansville Otters fall on day camp day - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ronald Clark ,\n1 hours ago\nEVANSVILLE, Ind. (WEHT) — The Evansville Otters got in a hole early and were unable to climb out falling to the Mississippi Mud Monsters in game two of their series 8-4.\nThe rubber match of the series is Thursday, June 4th, at 6:35 p.m. at Bosse Field.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
